@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nii-il33-nouns`
IMPORT `nii-il33-readings`
IMPORT `nii-schedule-a1-ages`
IMPORT `nii-s2a-residence`
IMPORT `nii-statuses-chapters`

-- ===========================================================================
-- National Insurance Law s 238 (סעיף 238, "הגדרות" of Chapter 11): "עקרת בית" (housewife), "אלמנה" (widow)
-- and "אלמנה בת קצבה" (widow pensioner). Row IL-33. Source lines 2401-2430.
--
-- WHY. s 65(a) "מבוטח" reads "למעט עקרת בית כהגדרתה בסעיף 238" in both limbs, and s 335(b) and (i) read the
-- housewife and the widow pensioner. Row IL-06 (fork F18) and row IL-08 take both as inputs. This module
-- derives them from facts. It does NOT rule on IL-06's fork F18 (whether a resident housewife is insured
-- under limb (2) of s 65): that fork reads the definition, and stays as it is.
--
-- A NOTE ON "INSURED UNDER CHAPTER 11" FOR A HOUSEWIFE. s 240(a) insures every resident of 18 or over, so a
-- resident housewife is, by that section, insured under Chapter 11 (the definition "עקרת בית" itself says
-- her spouse is "insured under this Chapter" and does not say she is not). s 65 and s 335 carve her out by
-- name ("למעט עקרת בית"). A record that gives a housewife `insured under Chapter 11` FALSE, as the capstone
-- does, is therefore an input convention, not a reading of s 240; the answers of ss 65 and 335 are the same
-- either way (NOTES.md, "Two readings of the housewife's own insurance").
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 238 — housewife, widow, widow pensioner`

§§ `"עקרת בית": a housewife`

-- src:2428 | ”עקרת בית“ – אשה נשואה, למעט עגונה, שבן זוגה מבוטח לפי פרק זה, שאינה עובדת ואינה עובדת עצמאית, ובכלל זה אישה כאמור שהיא חברת קיבוץ מתחדש;
-- "אשה נשואה, למעט עגונה, שבן זוגה מבוטח לפי פרק זה, שאינה עובדת ואינה עובדת עצמאית".
-- A married woman, other than an agunah, whose spouse is insured under this Chapter, who is not an employee
-- and not self-employed. "Married" (נשואה) is not s 1's "אשתו", which includes a woman known in public as
-- a man's wife: whether the wider reading reaches s 238 is fork H1, RULED by Meng on 2026-10-08 (SHRUG):
-- declined by default, and declined only where the answer depends on it.
@ref NII s 238 "עקרת בית", line 2428; s 1 "עגונה", line 203
GIVEN m IS A `A woman's marriage`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 — an agunah:` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m's `marital status`
    WHEN `married` THEN
            m's `her spouse's traces have vanished for two years`
        OR  m's `her spouse has been abroad for two years without her consent and has not supported her in that time`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref NII s 238 "עקרת בית", line 2428
GIVEN married   IS A BOOLEAN
      w         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      m         IS A `A woman's marriage`
      sp        IS A MAYBE `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      `the day` IS A DATE
      rd        IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a housewife, taking the word married as` married `:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` `, reading` rd MEANS
        w's sex EQUALS `female`
    AND NOT (w's work)'s `an employee`
    AND NOT (w's work)'s `a self-employed person`
    AND married
    AND NOT `s 1 — an agunah:` m
    AND CONSIDER sp
        WHEN NOTHING THEN
            REFUSE "section 238 \"עקרת בית\" turns on whether the woman's spouse is insured under Chapter 11, and the case gives no record of the spouse"
        WHEN JUST s THEN
            `s 240 — insured under Chapter 11:` s `on` `the day` `, reading` rd

@ref NII s 238 "עקרת בית", line 2428; s 1 "אשתו", line 129; fork H1
GIVEN w         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      m         IS A `A woman's marriage`
      sp        IS A MAYBE `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      `the day` IS A DATE
      rd        IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a housewife:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` `, reading` rd MEANS
    CONSIDER rd's `the word married in the definition of a housewife`
    WHEN `married means married only` THEN narrow
    WHEN `married includes a woman known in public as the wife and living with him` THEN wide
    WHEN `the word married is declined for a woman known in public as the wife` THEN
        CONSIDER m's `marital status`
        WHEN `known in public as the wife of a man and living with him, without being married to him` THEN
            IF   narrow EQUALS wide
            THEN narrow
            ELSE REFUSE "section 238 says אשה נשואה (a married woman); section 1 says אשתו (his wife) includes a woman known in public as his wife who lives with him; the woman is known in public as a wife and not married, and the text does not say whether s 238 reaches her"
        OTHERWISE narrow
    WHERE
        narrow MEANS `s 238 — a housewife, taking the word married as` (m's `marital status` EQUALS `married`) `:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` `, reading` rd
        wide   MEANS `s 238 — a housewife, taking the word married as` (   m's `marital status` EQUALS `married`
                                                                          OR m's `marital status` EQUALS `known in public as the wife of a man and living with him, without being married to him`) `:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` `, reading` rd

@ref NII s 238 "עקרת בית"; the ruling above
GIVEN w         IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      m         IS A `A woman's marriage`
      sp        IS A MAYBE `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a housewife:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` MEANS
    `s 238 — a housewife:` w `, her marriage` m `, her spouse` sp `, on` `the day` `, reading` `the readings this row takes`

§§ `"אלמנה": a widow`

-- src:2403 | ”אלמנה“ – מי שהיתה אשתו של המבוטח בשעת פטירתו, להוציא –
-- src:2404 | (1) מי שהיתה אשתו פחות משנה, ואם היא בת 55 שנים ומעלה – פחות מחצי שנה, ולא ילדה לו ילד;
-- src:2405 | (2) מי שבחמש השנים האחרונות שלפני פטירת המבוטח היתה נפרדת ממנו שלוש שנים לפחות ובכללן 12 חודשים שלפני פטירת המבוטח ולא היתה זכאית למזונות ממנו על פי פסק דין של בית משפט או בית דין מוסמך או על פי הסכם בכתב, או שהמבוטח לא נשא למעשה במזונותיה תוך 12 החודשים שלפני פטירתו; פסקה זו לא תחול על אשה שבעת פטירתו של המבוטח שולמה בעדה תוספת תלויים לפי סעיפים 200 או 244;
-- "מי שהיתה אשתו של המבוטח בשעת פטירתו, להוציא (1) מי שהיתה אשתו פחות משנה, ואם היא בת 55 שנים ומעלה – פחות
-- מחצי שנה, ולא ילדה לו ילד; (2) ...". The age of 55 is taken at the death ("בשעת פטירתו" opens the
-- definition and the condition is in the present tense; fork W2, class (b): NOTES.md).
@ref NII s 238 "אלמנה" (1), lines 2403-2404
GIVEN w  IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      wd IS A `A widowing`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a widow excluded by paragraph (1), a short marriage without a child:` w `, widowed` wd MEANS
        NOT wd's `she bore him a child`
    AND IF   `a person born on` (w's `date of birth`) `has reached the age in months` 660 `on` (wd's `the day of his death`)
        THEN (wd's `the day of his death`) LESS THAN `add months` (wd's `the day of the marriage`) 6
        ELSE (wd's `the day of his death`) LESS THAN `add years` (wd's `the day of the marriage`) 1

-- (2): in the five years before the death she was separated from him for three years or more, including
-- the twelve months before it, and either was not entitled to maintenance from him or he did not in fact
-- bear her maintenance in those twelve months; the paragraph does not apply to a woman for whom a
-- dependants' supplement was paid under s 200 or 244. The scope of the last "or" is fork W1.
@ref NII s 238 "אלמנה" (2), line 2405; fork W1
GIVEN wd IS A `A widowing`
      rd IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a widow excluded by paragraph (2), a long separation:` wd `, reading` rd MEANS
        NOT wd's `a dependants' supplement was paid for her at his death under section 200 or 244`
    AND CONSIDER rd's `the maintenance limb of the definition of a widow`
        WHEN `the maintenance limbs are alternatives inside the condition of separation` THEN inside
        WHEN `the lack of actual maintenance is an alternative to the whole of the separation condition` THEN whole
        WHEN `the grammar of the maintenance limb is declined where the two readings differ` THEN
            IF   inside EQUALS whole
            THEN inside
            ELSE REFUSE "paragraph (2) of the definition of a widow joins its maintenance limbs with an 'or' (not entitled to maintenance, or the insured did not in fact bear her maintenance) whose scope the text does not fix: inside the condition of separation, or as an alternative to the whole of it"
    WHERE
        sep        MEANS wd's `in the five years before his death she was separated from him for three years or more, including the twelve months before his death`
        entitled   MEANS wd's `she was entitled to maintenance from him by a judgment or a written agreement`
        borne      MEANS wd's `he did in fact bear her maintenance in the twelve months before his death`
        inside     MEANS sep AND ((NOT entitled) OR (NOT borne))
        whole      MEANS (sep AND (NOT entitled)) OR (NOT borne)

@ref NII s 238 "אלמנה", lines 2403-2405
GIVEN w  IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      wd IS A `A widowing`
      rd IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a widow:` w `, widowed` wd `, reading` rd MEANS
        wd's `she was his wife at his death`
    AND NOT `s 238 — a widow excluded by paragraph (1), a short marriage without a child:` w `, widowed` wd
    AND NOT `s 238 — a widow excluded by paragraph (2), a long separation:` wd `, reading` rd

@ref NII s 238 "אלמנה בת קצבה", line 2429
GIVEN w  IS A `A person for the statuses of the Law`
      wd IS A `A widowing`
      pf IS A `A widow's pension fact`
      rd IS A `The readings this row takes where the text does not decide`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 238 — a widow pensioner:` w `, widowed` wd `, her pension` pf `, reading` rd MEANS
        NOT (w's work)'s `an employee`
    AND NOT (w's work)'s `a self-employed person`
    AND pf's `entitled to a pension under section 132(1) to (5) or section 252`
    AND `s 238 — a widow:` w `, widowed` wd `, reading` rd
